ow the dog on the first night  will turn her up yeah from from night  tremors I mean that's extraordinary no  they're making people functional human  they are literally saving lives and  Sharon wants to bring attention to the  issue of suicide among veterans that we  talked about it is an enormous problem  and these dogs can really help with it  and there are other groups I know that  do some of the training for the dogs but  the same thing you've got to get money  to them because they're not support it's  not government  but we thank you don we thank you

